## Testing policy

- Do **not** run Vitest unit tests (`npm run test`, `vitest`, `*.test.ts`) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do **not** run Playwright E2E tests (`npm run test:e2e`, `npm run test:caf`) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do **not** add new unit or E2E test files unless the user explicitly asks.
- Existing test files may remain in the repo; they are optional and not part of the default workflow.
